 ('What makes a good short-term rental comparable?', 'Match location, lawful capacity, guest segment, amenities, availability and data period. Document exclusions and distinguish modeled performance from verified owner records rather than cherry-picking higher revenue.'),
 ('Should first-year revenue equal established comparable performance?', 'Not automatically. Build the actual opening calendar and identify supported operating assumptions. Review count does not establish a universal discount or guaranteed revenue advantage.'),
 ('Does lower Airbnb occupancy mean lower cleaning expense?', 'No. Turnovers depend on check-ins and length of stay, not occupancy alone. Compare cleaning receipts and actual turnover charges separately, with the same expense scope in every purchase case.')
